  "title": "CI: disable ENABLE_ZLIBNG in no-options build",
  "description": "ENABLE_ZLIBNG defaults ON and is independent of ENABLE_ZLIB, so the\nno-options build still pulled in zlib-ng where installed (e.g. macOS\nHomebrew), defining HAVE_ZLIBNG and compiling the gzip paths.\n\nThis practically prevents no options test builds on macOS\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
